# Invariants 5 and 6: the instance kicks bob while he is offline. Its Remove freezes the group -
# alice's message is refused 425 until a member commits the Remove - alice commits it, carol then
# joins through the instance's Add, and bob, back online, is no longer a current leaf.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
group chat kind=text target=d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2 community=none creator=alice
join bob chat via=welcome
sync bob
go_offline bob
kick alice bob
expect_425 send alice chat before the kick is committed
commit alice
join carol chat via=welcome
send alice chat welcome carol
expect_decrypts carol chat welcome carol
go_online bob
expect_reject E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT send bob chat am I still here
